# Unit18
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit18核心词汇

fruit/fruːt/水果/Eating fresh fruit is good for health.
fuel/ˈfjuːəl/燃料/The price of fuel has gone up.
fulfill/fʊlˈfɪl/实现；履行/She fulfilled her dream of becoming a doctor.
full/fʊl/满的/The glass is full of water.
fun/fʌn/乐趣/Swimming is a lot of fun.
function/ˈfʌŋkʃn/功能；函数/What is the function of this button?
fund/fʌnd/基金；资助/The government will fund the research project.
fundamental/ˌfʌndəˈmentl/基本的/Honesty is a fundamental value.
funeral/ˈfjuːnərəl/葬礼/Many people attended the funeral.
funny/ˈfʌni/有趣的/He told a funny joke.
furniture/ˈfɜːrnɪtʃər/家具/We need to buy some new furniture.
further/ˈfɜːrðər/进一步的/We need further information to make a decision.
future/ˈfjuːtʃər/未来/What are your plans for the future?
gain/ɡeɪn/获得；增加/She gained valuable experience from the internship.
gallery/ˈɡæləri/画廊/They visited an art gallery last weekend.
game/ɡeɪm/游戏；比赛/The football game was very exciting.
gap/ɡæp/缺口；差距/There is a large gap between the rich and the poor.
garage/ɡəˈrɑːʒ/车库/He parked the car in the garage.
garden/ˈɡɑːrdn/花园/She planted flowers in the garden.
gas/ɡæs/气体；汽油/We need to stop for gas.
gather/ˈɡæðər/聚集/People gathered in the town square.
gay/ɡeɪ/快乐的；同性恋的/The children were gay and carefree.
generation/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn/一代人/The younger generation is more open-minded.
general/ˈdʒenrəl/一般的；将军/In general, the plan is acceptable.
generate/ˈdʒenəreɪt/产生/The wind turbines generate electricity.
generous/ˈdʒenərəs/慷慨的/She is very generous with her time.
genius/ˈdʒiːniəs/天才/Einstein was a mathematical genius.
gentle/ˈdʒentl/温柔的/She has a gentle and kind personality.
genuine/ˈdʒenjuɪn/真正的/This is a genuine diamond ring.
gesture/ˈdʒestʃər/手势/He made a gesture of welcome.
get/ɡet/获得；到达/I got a new job last month.
giant/ˈdʒaɪənt/巨大的；巨人/A giant wave hit the ship.
gift/ɡɪft/礼物；天赋/She has a gift for music.
girl/ɡɜːrl/女孩/The little girl is playing in the park.
give/ɡɪv/给/Please give me the book.
glad/ɡlæd/高兴的/I'm glad to see you again.
glance/ɡlæns/瞥一眼/She took a quick glance at her phone.
global/ˈɡloʊbl/全球的/Climate change is a global issue.
glory/ˈɡlɔːri/光荣；荣誉/He won glory for his country.
go/ɡoʊ/去/Let's go to the park.
goal/ɡoʊl/目标/Her goal is to become a teacher.
gold/ɡoʊld/黄金/She wore a gold necklace.
golden/ˈɡoʊldən/金色的/The golden sunset was beautiful.
good/ɡʊd/好的/She is a good student.
goods/ɡʊdz/商品/The store sells a variety of goods.
govern/ˈɡʌvərn/统治；管理/Who governs this country?
government/ˈɡʌvərnmənt/政府/The government announced new policies.
grade/ɡreɪd/等级；成绩/She got an A grade in the exam.
graduate/ˈɡrædʒueɪt/毕业/She graduated from university last year.
grain/ɡreɪn/谷物；颗粒/Rice is the main grain in this region.
